      "math_academy_id": "e-5255",
      "problem": "Let $Z=XY.$ What is the value of $z_{32}$, if\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14273053/assets/304a9d4f5f9302aec33472fa4daf3a3da3f4b7169c79cfd6c3fcb1771176a274.svg)",
      "worked_solution": "Multiplying the $3$rd row in $X$ by the $2$nd column in $Y$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{z}_{32} & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =1\\cdot (-1)+2\\cdot 4+3\\cdot (-2) \\\\  & =-1+8-6 \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
